  "content": {
    "title": "汪清县2010年公开招录优秀大学毕业生公告",
    "source": "",
    "publishDate": "2010-06-04",
    "bodyHtml": "\n                        <div class=\"mainlist bor\">\n            <h5>\n                <div class=\"ttt text20\">\n                    就业动态</div>\n            </h5>\n            <div>\n                <div class=\"titles\">\n                    <span id=\"lblTitle\" style=\"display:inline-block;\"><b><font size=\"5\">汪清县2010年公开招录优秀大学毕业生公告</font></b></span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"xian2\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"Issues\">\n                    <span id=\"lblIssue\" style=\"display:inline-block;\"><font size=\"3\">发布部门:信息管理部   发布时间:2010-6-4 0:00:00</font></span>\n                </div>\n               <div id=\"tdNewsContent\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.25pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312\"><font size=\"4\"><font color=\"#444444\">根据《汪清县<font face=\"仿宋_GB2312\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">2010</span>年公开招录优秀大学毕业生实施方案》，现将相关事宜公告如下：<span lang=\"EN-US\"><!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></span></font></font></font></span></p> <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.25pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文中宋\"><font face=\"仿宋_GB2312\"><font size=\"4\"><font color=\"#444444\">一、招录岗位<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></font></font></span></p> <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文中宋\"><font size=\"4\"><font color=\"#444444\">汪清县<font face=\"仿宋_GB2312\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">2010</span>年公开招录优秀大学毕业生岗位<span lang=\"EN-US\">26</span>个，招录人数<span lang=\"EN-US\">39</span>人。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></font></font></span></p> <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 40pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文中宋\"><font face=\"仿宋_GB2312\"><font size=\"4\"><font color=\"#444444\">二、招录条件<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></font></font></span></p> <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文中宋\"><font size=\"4\"><font color=\"#444444\">（一）具有中华人民共和国国籍；<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></font></span></p> <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文中宋\"><font size=\"4\"><font color=\"#444444\">（二）遵守宪法和法律，无犯罪记录；<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></font></span></p> <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文中宋\"><font size=\"4\"><font color=\"#444444\">（三）遵守职业操守，具有良好的品行；<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></font></span></p> <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文中宋\"><font size=\"4\"><font color=\"#444444\">（四）具有岗位所需的专业知识或技能；<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></font></span></p> <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0\"><font size=\"4\"><font color=\"#444444\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文中宋\">（五）</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312\">国家全日制统招本科及以上学历毕业生；<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></font></font></p> <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0\"><font size=\"4\"><font color=\"#444444\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312\">（六）</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文中宋\">年龄在<font face=\"仿宋_GB2312\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">26</span>周岁以下，</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312\">其中研究生及以上学历可放宽至<font face=\"仿宋_GB2312\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">30</span>周岁</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文中宋\">； <span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></font></font></p> <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文中宋\"><font size=\"4\"><font color=\"#444444\">（七）适应岗位要求的身体条件；<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></font></span></p> <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文中宋\"><font size=\"4\"><font color=\"#444444\">（八）符合岗位要求的其他资格条件。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></font></span></p> <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体\"><font face=\"仿宋_GB2312\"><font size=\"4\"><font color=\"#444444\">三、招录步骤<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></font></font></span></p> <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0\"><font size=\"4\"><font color=\"#444444\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312\">招录工作采取考试、考核相结合的办法进行。具体招录步骤：报名、笔试、面试、考核、体检、公示、录用。</span><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></font></font></p> <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0\"><font size=\"4\"><font color=\"#444444\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312\">报名时间</span></b><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312\">：<font face=\"仿宋_GB2312\"><!--?xml:namespace prefix = st1 ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:smarttags\" /--><st1:chsdate w:st=\"on\" isrocdate=\"False\" islunardate=\"False\" day=\"7\" month=\"6\" year=\"2010\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">6</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">7</span>日</st1:chsdate>至<st1:chsdate w:st=\"on\" isrocdate=\"False\" islunardate=\"False\" day=\"7\" month=\"7\" year=\"2010\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">7</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">7</span>日</st1:chsdate>（不含节假日）。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></span></font></font></p> <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0\"><font size=\"4\"><font color=\"#444444\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312\">报名地点</span></b><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312\">：县机构编制委员会办公室综合科（中共汪清县委大楼一楼西侧）。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></font></font></p> <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312\"><font size=\"4\"><font color=\"#444444\">招录具体岗位和报名事宜请登录汪清县大学生成长促进会网站，网址：<span lang=\"EN-US\"><a href=\"http://www.wqdch.com/\"><font face=\"仿宋_GB2312\">www.wqdch.com</font></a></span>。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></font></span></p> <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 31.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 1.96\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312\"><font face=\"仿宋_GB2312\"><font size=\"4\"><font color=\"#444444\">招录咨询电话<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></font></font></span></b></p> <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312\"><font size=\"4\"><font color=\"#444444\">0433-8852855<o:p></o:p></font></font></span></p> <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 288pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 18.0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312\"><font size=\"4\"><font color=\"#444444\">中共汪清县委<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></font></span></p> <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 280pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 17.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312\"><font size=\"4\"><font color=\"#444444\">汪清县人民政府<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></font></span></p> <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 264pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 16.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312\"><font size=\"4\"><font color=\"#444444\">二<font face=\"仿宋_GB2312\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">O</span>一<span lang=\"EN-US\">O</span>年<st1:chsdate w:st=\"on\" isrocdate=\"False\" islunardate=\"False\" day=\"7\" month=\"6\" year=\"2010\">六月七日</st1:chsdate></font></font></font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"xian2\">\n            </div>\n            <table width=\"100%\">\n                <tbody><tr>\n                    <td width=\"10%\" height=\"23\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" align=\"right\">\n                        附件：\n                    </td>\n                    <td>\n                        &nbsp;\n                    </td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td>\n                        &nbsp;\n                    </td>\n                    <td width=\"90%\" height=\"23\" align=\"left\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\">\n                        \n                    </td>\n                </tr>\n            </tbody></table>\n        </div>\n                    ",
